{"id":"sp-yue-001","audio":"audio/synthetic/sp-yue-001.wav","text":"我今日好忙，唔得閒食飯。","tags":["dialect"],"source":"synthetic-say","say_voice":"Sinji","licence":"CC0-1.0","speaker":"macOS say: Sinji","split":"dev","notes":"From PR #82 chinese-variants corpus (c01)."}
{"id":"sp-yue-002","audio":"audio/synthetic/sp-yue-002.wav","text":"佢頭先話份報告聽日先可以俾我哋。","tags":["dialect"],"source":"synthetic-say","say_voice":"Sinji","licence":"CC0-1.0","speaker":"macOS say: Sinji","split":"dev","notes":"From PR #82 (c02)."}
{"id":"sp-yue-003","audio":"audio/synthetic/sp-yue-003.wav","text":"你睇下呢個問題係咪咁樣。","tags":["dialect"],"source":"synthetic-say","say_voice":"Sinji","licence":"CC0-1.0","speaker":"macOS say: Sinji","split":"dev","notes":"From PR #82 (c03)."}
{"id":"sp-yue-004","audio":"audio/synthetic/sp-yue-004.wav","text":"我哋已經將文件發咗俾客，佢哋仲未覆。","tags":["dialect"],"source":"synthetic-say","say_voice":"Sinji","licence":"CC0-1.0","speaker":"macOS say: Sinji","split":"dev","notes":"From PR #82 (c04)."}
{"id":"sp-yue-005","audio":"audio/synthetic/sp-yue-005.wav","text":"呢個週末天氣好好，我想去公園行下。","tags":["dialect"],"source":"synthetic-say","say_voice":"Sinji","licence":"CC0-1.0","speaker":"macOS say: Sinji","split":"dev","notes":"From PR #82 (c05)."}
{"id":"sp-yue-006","audio":"audio/synthetic/sp-yue-006.wav","text":"佢唔喺屋企，你遲啲再打俾佢啦。","tags":["dialect"],"source":"synthetic-say","say_voice":"Sinji","licence":"CC0-1.0","speaker":"macOS say: Sinji","split":"dev","notes":"From PR #82 (c06)."}
{"id":"sp-yue-007","audio":"audio/synthetic/sp-yue-007.wav","text":"而家冇足夠時間做呢件事。","tags":["dialect"],"source":"synthetic-say","say_voice":"Sinji","licence":"CC0-1.0","speaker":"macOS say: Sinji","split":"dev","notes":"From PR #82 (c07)."}
{"id":"sp-yue-008","audio":"audio/synthetic/sp-yue-008.wav","text":"你可唔可以幫我睇下點解部電腦開唔到？","tags":["dialect"],"source":"synthetic-say","say_voice":"Sinji","licence":"CC0-1.0","speaker":"macOS say: Sinji","split":"holdout","notes":"From PR #82 (c08)."}
{"id": "sp-yue-009", "audio": "audio/synthetic/sp-yue-009.wav", "text": "你幫我同Niamh講，OraType下個禮拜出新版。", "tags": ["names", "mixed-language", "dictionary"], "source": "synthetic-say", "say_voice": "Sinji", "licence": "CC0-1.0", "speaker": "macOS say: Sinji", "split": "dev", "dictionary": ["Niamh", "OraType", "Tauri"], "terms": ["Niamh", "OraType"], "notes": "Plan dictionary-to-speech: dictionary words that are said must come out spelled as in the dictionary."}
{"id": "sp-yue-010", "audio": "audio/synthetic/sp-yue-010.wav", "text": "我哋聽日喺鰂魚涌同葉梓聰開會。", "tags": ["names", "dialect", "dictionary"], "source": "synthetic-say", "say_voice": "Sinji", "licence": "CC0-1.0", "speaker": "macOS say: Sinji", "split": "dev", "dictionary": ["葉梓聰", "鰂魚涌"], "terms": ["葉梓聰", "鰂魚涌"], "notes": "Plan dictionary-to-speech: dictionary words that are said must come out spelled as in the dictionary. 梓聰 sounds like 子涌 (cung1), the 涌 of the place name before it."}
{"id": "sp-yue-011", "audio": "audio/synthetic/sp-yue-011.wav", "text": "啲log已經send咗去Grafana，你睇下Kubernetes有冇報錯。", "tags": ["names", "mixed-language", "dictionary"], "source": "synthetic-say", "say_voice": "Sinji", "licence": "CC0-1.0", "speaker": "macOS say: Sinji", "split": "dev", "dictionary": ["Grafana", "Kubernetes", "Qdrant"], "terms": ["Grafana", "Kubernetes"], "notes": "Plan dictionary-to-speech: dictionary words that are said must come out spelled as in the dictionary."}
{"id": "sp-yue-012", "audio": "audio/synthetic/sp-yue-012.wav", "text": "你寫低個名或者type個名落去都得。", "tags": ["mixed-language", "dictionary"], "source": "synthetic-say", "say_voice": "Sinji", "licence": "CC0-1.0", "speaker": "macOS say: Sinji", "split": "dev", "dictionary": ["OraType", "Tauri"], "must_not_contain": ["OraType"], "notes": "Plan dictionary-to-speech: a sound-alike of a dictionary word that is not said; the word must not be forced in."}
{"id": "sp-yue-013", "audio": "audio/synthetic/sp-yue-013.wav", "text": "佢今晚唔使返嚟食飯。", "tags": ["dialect", "dictionary"], "source": "synthetic-say", "say_voice": "Sinji", "licence": "CC0-1.0", "speaker": "macOS say: Sinji", "split": "dev", "dictionary": ["葉梓聰", "鰂魚涌", "OraType"], "must_not_contain": ["葉梓聰", "OraType"], "notes": "Plan dictionary-to-speech: none of the dictionary words is said."}
{"id": "sp-yue-014", "audio": "audio/synthetic/sp-yue-014.wav", "text": "陳凱澄話Supabase嗰邊已經搞掂。", "tags": ["names", "mixed-language", "dictionary"], "source": "synthetic-say", "say_voice": "Sinji", "licence": "CC0-1.0", "speaker": "macOS say: Sinji", "split": "holdout", "dictionary": ["陳凱澄", "Supabase", "OraType"], "terms": ["陳凱澄", "Supabase"], "notes": "Plan dictionary-to-speech: dictionary words that are said must come out spelled as in the dictionary."}
